### 3.6 Plugin Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Plugin System
        PR["Plugin Registry (Server)"]
        PH["Plugin Host (Client)"]
        WASM["WASM Sandbox"]
        AWP["AudioWorklet Processor"]
        GUI["Plugin GUI (iframe)"]
    end

    PR -->|manifest.json| PH
    PH -->|load| WASM
    PH -->|register| AWP
    PH -->|render| GUI
    AWP -->|audio I/O| AE["Audio Engine"]
```

**Plugin format:** Custom JSON manifest + WASM/JS DSP + React GUI

```json
{
  "id": "com.soundforge.eq3band",
  "name": "3-Band EQ",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "category": "equalizer",
  "author": "SoundForge",
  "dsp": "eq3band-processor.wasm",
  "gui": "eq3band-gui.js",
  "parameters": [
    { "id": "lowGain",  "name": "Low",  "min": -24, "max": 24, "default": 0, "unit": "dB" },
    { "id": "midGain",  "name": "Mid",  "min": -24, "max": 24, "default": 0, "unit": "dB" },
    { "id": "highGain", "name": "High", "min": -24, "max": 24, "default": 0, "unit": "dB" }
  ]
}
```

**Built-in plugins:**
- **EQ** (3-band parametric)
- **Compressor** (threshold, ratio, attack, release, knee)
- **Reverb** (convolution-based, IR loading)
- **Delay** (sync to BPM, feedback, mix)
- **Chorus / Flanger**
- **Gain / Utility**
- **Limiter** (on master bus)

**Third-party plugin support:**
- Sandboxed WASM execution (memory-limited)
- Plugin GUI rendered in sandboxed `<iframe>`
- Communication via `MessagePort` (structured clone)

---

### 3.7 Collaboration System

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as User A (Editor)
    participant S as Collaboration Server
    participant B as User B (Editor)

    A->>S: ws:connect(projectId, token)
    S->>A: sync:state (full project snapshot)
    B->>S: ws:connect(projectId, token)
    S->>B: sync:state (full project snapshot)

    A->>S: op:addClip({trackId, clip})
    S->>S: Apply CRDT merge
    S->>B: op:addClip({trackId, clip})

    B->>S: op:moveClip({clipId, newStart})
    S->>S: Apply CRDT merge
    S->>A: op:moveClip({clipId, newStart})

    Note over S: Persist merged state to DB every 5s
```

**Design:**
- **Transport:** Socket.IO with rooms (one room = one project)
- **Conflict resolution:** Operation-based CRDT (Yjs library)
  - Each track/clip/parameter is a Yjs `Y.Map`
  - Concurrent edits merge automatically
  - No central locking needed
- **Awareness:** Cursor positions, selected clips, and user avatars broadcast to all peers
- **Latency:** Operations broadcast in < 50ms on typical connections
- **Persistence:** Server saves CRDT document to PostgreSQL every 5 seconds

**Operations envelope:**
```typescript
interface CollabOperation {
  type: 'addTrack' | 'removeTrack' | 'addClip' | 'moveClip'
       | 'updateParam' | 'splitClip' | 'deleteClip';
  userId: string;
  timestamp: number;
  payload: Record<string, unknown>;
}
```

**Presence system:**
```typescript
interface UserPresence {
  userId: string;
  name: string;
  avatar: string;
  color: string;        // assigned collaboration cursor color
  selectedClipIds: string[];
  cursorBeat: number;   // position on timeline
  isOnline: boolean;
}
```

