### 3.8 AI Music Assistant

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph AI Features
        CS["Chord Suggestion"]
        MG["Melody Generation"]
        SS["Stem Separation"]
        MX["Auto-Mix"]
        LY["Lyric Assistant"]
    end

    subgraph Backend
        AI_API["AI Service (Node.js)"]
        OAI["OpenAI API"]
        REP["Replicate (MusicGen)"]
        DEMUCS["Demucs (Stem Sep)"]
    end

    CS --> AI_API --> OAI
    MG --> AI_API --> REP
    SS --> AI_API --> DEMUCS
    MX --> AI_API --> OAI
    LY --> AI_API --> OAI
```

**AI features:**

| Feature | Input | Output | Backend |
|---------|-------|--------|---------|
| **Chord Suggestion** | Current progression + key | Next chord options | GPT-4 (music theory prompt) |
| **Melody Generation** | Chord progression + style | MIDI melody clip | MusicGen / custom model |
| **Stem Separation** | Audio file | 4 stems (vocals, drums, bass, other) | Demucs (server-side) |
| **Auto-Mix** | Track levels + EQ | Suggested mix settings | GPT-4 (audio analysis) |
| **Lyric Assistant** | Theme, mood, genre | Lyrics with syllable counts | GPT-4 |
| **Sound Design** | Text description | Synthesized audio | AudioLDM / MusicGen |

**API endpoints:**

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/ai/chords` | Suggest next chords |
| `POST` | `/api/ai/melody` | Generate melody MIDI |
| `POST` | `/api/ai/stems` | Separate stems (async job) |
| `POST` | `/api/ai/mix` | Auto-mix suggestions |
| `POST` | `/api/ai/lyrics` | Generate lyrics |
| `GET`  | `/api/ai/jobs/:id` | Poll async job status |

